Iteration Loop
1. Assume initial αF = 0
2. Find LF and DF from wind tunnel tables of the fuselage
3. Compute T and αTPP using drag, weight, fuselage
forces, HM, and HT. Neglect HM and HT in first iteration
4. Use information on c.g of fuselage to find αF
5. Iterate step 2 to 4 until quantities converge.
